  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-014-jin098-huanwen-opening:appearance" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-014-jin098-huanwen-opening:appearance:m0000" ref="izd_fga_3aj">劉尹</persName>道<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-014-jin098-huanwen-opening:appearance:m0003" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">桓公</persName>：鬢如反猬皮，眉如紫石稜，自是<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-014-jin098-huanwen-opening:appearance:m0020" ref="572_278_cba">孫仲謀</persName>、<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-014-jin098-huanwen-opening:appearance:m0024" ref="dkn_ge4_286_AAAA">司馬宣王</persName>一流人。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-014-jin098-huanwen-opening:naming" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-014-jin098-huanwen-opening:naming:m0000" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">溫</persName>為<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-014-jin098-huanwen-opening:naming:m0002" ref="6v8_pk9_7k5">溫嶠</persName>所賞，故名<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-014-jin098-huanwen-opening:naming:m0009" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">溫</persName>。</p>
